# Rapid-profile verification debt (T-1681) -- tracked deliberately
!rapid-debt.jsonl

# T-2721: waive-audit progress watermark -- tracked deliberately, same
# posture as rapid-debt.jsonl above. Was `.frob/waive-audit-watermark.json`
# (gitignored, per-checkout) until T-2721: an agent's audit pass ran inside
# a disposable worktree and its progress was destroyed with it on cleanup,
# defeating T-2467's whole periodic-incremental design. Tracked at the repo
# root, outside `.frob/`, so it survives a worktree's removal and a `frob
# ticket land`/git push actually carries it.
!waive-audit-watermark.json

# Stray agent done-report scratch files (T-2524): the canonical home is
# tickets/<id>/done-report.md
done-report-*.md
